wildos-shell (0.1.2) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Blur windows in the background never blurs the window in use, its
    dialogs or the window they belong to, and screenshot overlays no longer
    count as the window in use, so screenshots come out clear.
  * The lightest blur is lighter, a single pass.
  * Outline windows leaves a window without its edge while it is blurred in
    the background, and can leave out maximised windows and windows that
    fill the screen.

